"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &ksquares;...</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Opens a dialog to configure &ksquares;.</action> See <link linkend="
"\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> section for details."
msgstr ""
"<action>Otvara dijalog za konfiguraciju &ksquares;.</action> Vidi <link "
"linkend=\"configuration\">Konfiguraciju igre</link> odjeljak za detalje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &ksquares; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the sections "
"about the <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Settings "
"Menu</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"Dodatno &ksquares; ima čest &kde; <guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> "
"i<guimenu>Pomoć</guimenu> stavke izbornika, za više informacija pročitajte "
"sekcije o <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-settings\">Postavke "
"menija</ulink> and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/ui.html#menus-help"
"\">Pomoćni meni</ulink> of the &kde; Osnove."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Često postavljena pitanja"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "Želim da promijenim izgled igre. Mogu li ?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Currently the only thing you can change about the game look is the color of "
"the lines. To do so use <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &ksquares;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> on "
"the menubar. See <link linkend=\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> "
"section for details."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno jedino što možete promijeniti u izgledu igre je boja linije. Da "
"biste to učinili koristiti <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &ksquares;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> na "
"meniju. Vidi <link linkend=\"configuration\">Konfiguracija igre</link> "
"odjeljak za detalje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr "Napravio sam grešku. Mogu li poništiti?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &ksquares; doesn't currently have an <quote>Undo</quote> feature."
msgstr "Ne. &ksquares; nema trenutno <quote>Poništi</quote> opciju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play the game?"
msgstr "Mogu li koristiti tastaturu za igranje igre?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &ksquares; cannot be played using keyboard."
msgstr "Ne. &ksquares; ne može se igrati koristeći tastaturu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr "Ne mogu da shvatim šta da radim ovdje! Da li postoje nagovještaji?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. There is no <quote>Hint</quote> feature implemented yet."
msgstr "Ne. Nema <quote>Nagovještaj</quote> opcije implementirane još."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:204
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""
"Moram da napustim igru, ali još nije gotova. Da li mogu da snimim napredak?"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid "&ksquares; does not have a saving feature."
msgstr "&ksquares; nema spasi opcije."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija igre"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Game Dialog"
msgstr "Novi dijalog igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:215
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>New Game</guilabel> dialog consistes of the following "
"groupboxes:"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Nova igra</guilabel>dijalog sadržan od sljedećih grupisanih kutija:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid "Players"
msgstr "Igrači"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can change the number of participating players, as well as "
"determine who will be played by human and who by the artificial "
"intelligence. Use the <guilabel>Number of players</guilabel> selection box "
"to specify the number of participants. Then type a name for each participant "
"and use the check box to specify the player type."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete promijeniti broj igrača koji učestvuju, kao i odrediti koji će "
"se igrati od ljudskih a koji od strane umjetne inteligencije. Koristite "
"<guilabel> Broj igrača </guilabel>izbor kutije da navedete broj učesnika. "
"Zatim unesite naziv za svakog učesnika i koristite kutiju za čekiranje da "
"odredite tip igrača."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:222
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Board"
msgstr "Ploča za igru"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can regulate the size of the game board. Use the <guilabel>Width</"
"guilabel> and <guilabel>Height</guilabel> selection boxes to change the "
"width and height of the game board."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete regulirati veličinu table. Koristite <guilabel>Širina</"
"guilabel> i <guilabel>Visina</guilabel> izbor kutije za promjenu širine i "
"visine table."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Settings"
msgstr "Postava igre"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:227
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This part of the configuration dialog regulates the difficulty of the game. "
"If you leave the <guilabel>Quick start</guilabel> check box unchecked - the "
"game will begin with the empty grid. Otherwise the game will start with the "
"game board partially filled."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj dio dijalog konfiguracije uređuje težinu igre. Ako ostavite "
"<guilabel>Brzi početak</guilabel> neoznačenu - igra će početi s praznom "
"mrežu. U suprotnom, igra će početi sa pločom djelomično popunjenom."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:232
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration Dialog"
msgstr "Konfiguracijski dijalog"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:233
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
